# The Vercel site is a static page; the Python scraper is CLI-only and must
# not be uploaded. Without this, Vercel sees requirements.txt/pyproject.toml,
# runs its Python builder, and fails the build hunting for an entrypoint.
requirements.txt
pyproject.toml
main.py
job_scraper/
tests/
config.yaml
README.md

# The tender_ai service is a separate FastAPI app, deployed on its own (see
# tender_ai/README.md), not part of the static Vercel site.
tender_ai/
